  "question": "Can a concrete numbered page inside the 2004 《百川归海，蔚为大观》 be identified without directly possessing the 2004 volume?",
  "answer": "Yes, at a high-confidence cross-publication citation-bridge layer, not by direct review of the 2004 page. Liu Qiang's official Palace Museum Journal article, printed p.60, reproduces Ji Shuying's statement that the better-known Song editions in the Tianlu Linlang Hou-bian were transferred to Beijing Library and footnotes it specifically to 《冀淑英文集》 p.335 (Beijing Library Press, 2004). An independent 2015 Taiwan National Central Library journal article reproduces the same Ji statement and cites it in author-year form as 冀淑英（2004）; that article's reference list expands the cited 2004 Ji item as 《百川归海，蔚为大观》 in 《冀淑英文集》. The convergent citation chain therefore binds Wenji p.335 to the Baichuan article with high confidence. It does not reveal whether p.335 is the article's first, last, or interior page, and the original p.335 has not been directly reviewed.",
